    "text": "Kāore i kitea he āhuatanga aukati. He pai te āhua o ngā taunakitanga motuhēhē me te horopaki whakahaere — whakapae he take taha-kiritaki (pihikete, whirihoranga takiuru rohe-ritenga) te rohe hē rānei.",
