  "web.admin.customers.list.orphanedAccounts.hint": {
    "text": "He pūkete kei te pātengi raraunga motuhēhē mō tēnei wāhitau, engari kāore he rekoata kiritaki e hāngai ana ki a ia. Ka taea tonu e te tangata te takiuru; kāore he aha kei te taupū kiritaki mōna. Whakatuwheratia te wāhitau mō ngā arowhai.",
